{"id":"n28333-5-7","stage":4,"title":"늘어지다 · 痛痛快快","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28333-5-7-1","ko":"어제가 휴일이었는데 뭐 했어?","zh":"昨天是休息日，你做了什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제가","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제가","audio":"/audio/2e92690e3e1daee3663d.mp3"}},{"text":"휴일이었는데","meaning":"休息日，公休日，假日","explanation":"휴일：休息日，公休日，假日；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"휴일","audio":"/audio/98c4721ccd1350f17224.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73252","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴일이었는데","audio":"/audio/8f59b0edd0ebc0ab71ca.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"했어?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어","audio":"/audio/76f3569b074c48dd5200.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"98c4721ccd1350f1","term":"휴일","zh":"休息日，公休日，假日","audio":"/audio/98c4721ccd1350f17224.mp3","entryId":"73252","definition":"如周日或法定假日等不工作、休息的日子。","pronunciation":["휴일"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/54d53a40467acb5cf5ac.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28333-5-7-2","ko":"휴일이라 오랜만에 늘어지게 잤지.","zh":"因为是休息日，所以难得地睡了个懒觉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"휴일이라","meaning":"休息日，公休日，假日","explanation":"휴일：休息日，公休日，假日；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"휴일","audio":"/audio/98c4721ccd1350f17224.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73252","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴일이라","audio":"/audio/c68ef7f814af14660f2f.mp3"}},{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만에","audio":"/audio/cf175d7879a1bf3c7749.mp3"}},{"text":"늘어지게","meaning":"痛痛快快，彻彻底底，无忧无虑","explanation":"늘어지다：痛痛快快，彻彻底底，无忧无虑；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"늘어지다","audio":"/audio/5731e3611246884ef993.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28333","senseId":"5","lemma":"늘어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘어지게","audio":"/audio/5ed9c874bf34c65ae556.mp3"}},{"text":"잤지.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잤지","audio":"/audio/ceb21122576b5bb481c6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"98c4721ccd1350f1","term":"휴일","zh":"休息日，公休日，假日","audio":"/audio/98c4721ccd1350f17224.mp3","entryId":"73252","definition":"如周日或法定假日等不工作、休息的日子。","pronunciation":["휴일"]},{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","z